[Desktop Entry]
Type=Service
Name=KDOS
Comment=KDOS commands, favourites by their two letters, routes, settings pages, packs on the boot medium, shortcuts and questions for the local model
Icon=start-here-kdos
X-KDE-PluginInfo-Name=kdos
X-KDE-PluginInfo-EnabledByDefault=true
X-Plasma-API=DBus2
X-Plasma-DBusRunner-Service=io.kdos.Runner
X-Plasma-DBusRunner-Path=/runner
X-Plasma-Request-Actions-Once=true
X-Plasma-Runner-Min-Letter-Count=2
X-Plasma-Runner-Syntaxes=accent :q:,phosphor on,tiling on,desk :q:,night light,update check,doctor,box stop :q:,box enter :q:,install :q:,keys :q:,why :q:,ask :q:,route:setup.network,FF
X-Plasma-Runner-Syntax-Descriptions=Switches the accent: phosphor\, amber\, ice\, bone\, norton\, borland\, perfect or paper,Turns Phosphor mode on or off,Turns automatic tiling on or off,Lays the desktop out as the kdos\, dock or tiling desk,Turns Night Light on or off,Checks for a system update and shows the answer in Konsole,Checks this system for problems,Stops a box,Opens a shell in a box,Finds :q: in Discover and among the packs on the boot medium,Lists the shortcuts whose action matches :q:,Explains a path with kdos why,Asks the language model on this machine\, whose answer Enter copies,Opens a route of /etc/kdos/menu.conf by its exact name,Two letters open the favourite whose code they are in ~/.config/kdos/favorites
